  "bodyHash": "0c042e78d567b684",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f90\"><strong>Fancy Block Particles</strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>本模组将旧版的2D原版粒子及少量其他粒子转化为3D效果！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZfiAoir.gif\" width=\"854\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f90\"><strong>主菜单</strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>在这里，您可以更改粒子的外观和行为方式</strong></span><img src=\"https://s18.postimg.org/ix42sdppz/image.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ALFzvyV.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"480\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://s18.postimg.org/ix42sdppz/image.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>您也可以将方块加入<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">黑名单</span></strong></span><img src=\"https://s18.postimg.org/44zd13wo7/exceptions_3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SiZsGZe.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f90\"><strong>非常欢迎您将此模组包含在您的整合包中 ;)</strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><strong>请在<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#000;text-decoration:underline\">GitHub</span></span>上提交<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#000;text-decoration:underline\">问题</span></span>和<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#000;text-decoration:underline\">建议</span></span>。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\"></span>我建议将此模组与<span><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/proportional-destruction-particles\" rel=\"nofollow\">Proportional Destruction Particles（比例破坏粒子）</a>模组搭配使用。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>灵感来源：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>灵感来自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fcraftland.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">craftland.org</a>的自定义Minecraft客户端功能：<br>（非独立模组）</strong></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QBNGaNDOfRY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>按键绑定：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>打开FBP菜单&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; '<span style=\"color:#f90\">P</span>'<br></strong><strong>快速黑名单菜单&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; '<span style=\"color:#f60\">X</span>'&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; （鼠标悬停在方块上 | 按住+Shift键手持方块）<br></strong><strong>切换冻结效果&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; '<span style=\"color:#9c0\">R</span>'<br></strong><strong>切换启用模组&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [<span style=\"color:#f00\">未设置</span>]</strong><br><strong>清除挖掘粒子&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [<span style=\"color:#f00\">未设置</span>]</strong></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong style=\"font-size:18px\">视频展示：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>感谢 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqooK6l52Pxph76TWp3z_Iw\" rel=\"nofollow\">Juger</a> 制作此视频！[EN]:<br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/G6lJ2YxkX1c?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><br>感谢 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCnPf9f-yQidQA6ByWVkbHVw\" rel=\"nofollow\">FuzionDroid</a> 制作此视频！[EN]:</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qodvsTdqPfM?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span>感谢 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQd_qzkQPcG8OyD7jLCZB5Q\" rel=\"nofollow\">KIKONUTINO</a> 制作此视频！[ES]:<span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RVou1JdctIs?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>感谢 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDxEskPXlwkngbSDu8y42Sw\" rel=\"nofollow\">Leonardo Fiori</a> 在他的视频中收录了此模组！<br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GK1vg_8oAyU?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>感谢 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCHPrll08p7FVI-4KECRmMwg\" rel=\"nofollow\">Awesome Meatball</a> 制作此视频！[EN]:<span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XC0sfbqrHi4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>感谢 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8glc4p1mnsMedT2nsSHIBQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">YourCrazy Friend</a> 制作此视频！[RU]:<br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3DJLkd9I6to?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>感谢 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0E_vIe1e1lVeojYOgVg_5Q\" rel=\"nofollow\">asianhalfsquat</a> 制作此视频！[EN]:<span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/KvNtuQRWGdg?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
